{"seq":2,"slug":"category-scatter","title":"品类与品牌散列窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-result-diversity-dedup/dedup-scatter/category-scatter","wordCount":2459,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"品类与品牌散列窗口\">品类与品牌散列窗口</h1><p>去重之后，列表里剩下的都是「不同的商品」，但仍可能挤在同一类目或同一品牌里。打散解决的就是这一步。它的形式化表述很朴素：给每个维度设一个<strong>窗口内最多出现几次</strong>的上限，然后重排列表使该约束满足。难度全在「约束冲突时怎么办」和「约束与相关性冲突时怎么办」这两个地方。本文讲清散列窗口的三种实现、它们的稳定性差异，以及配额冲突的四类解法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-窗口配额的三种形态\">核心概念：窗口配额的三种形态</h2><p>「窗口」的定义决定了算法的形态，工程上常用的有三种，它们对用户体感的对应关系不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>窗口形态</th>\n<th>约束形式</th>\n<th>体感对应</th>\n<th>实现难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前缀窗口</td>\n<td>任意长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 的前缀内，同类目 ≤ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 条</td>\n<td>「一屏内不重复」</td>\n<td>中（等价于滑动窗口）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定槽位</td>\n<td>位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i+w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 之间不得同类目</td>\n<td>「每隔 w 条换一个类目」</td>\n<td>低（贪心插空）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局配额</td>\n<td>整个列表内同类目 ≤ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 条</td>\n<td>「整页类目不要太多」</td>\n<td>低（截断）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>前缀窗口</strong>是最贴近用户体感的定义，因为它直接编码「任意连续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 条内不出现超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个同类目」。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时它是严格的「间隔至少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>」约束，等价于固定槽位；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时它比固定槽位宽松，允许一定程度的聚集。</p>\n<p><strong>固定槽位</strong>是最好实现的：把列表按类目分桶，然后按桶轮流取，每轮从一个桶取一条，取到该桶空为止。这个算法（round-robin）在类目分布均匀时表现很好，但在类目分布极不均匀时会产生尾巴问题——如果 80% 的候选都属于类目 A，轮流取完 20% 的其他类目后，剩下的全是 A，尾部整片同质。这时需要<strong>在尾部放松约束</strong>，否则算法无解。</p>\n<p><strong>全局配额</strong>最粗糙，但它有一个别的形态没有的好处：它是<strong>单调可截断</strong>的，不需要重排，直接在遍历时计数跳过即可。这使它成为延迟敏感路径的首选（降级策略见 <a href=\"../diversity-ops/diversity-degrade\">多样性计算超时降级</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[去重后列表] --&gt; B{选择约束形态}&#10;    B --&gt;|前缀窗口| C[滑动计数 + 冲突时向后找替代]&#10;    B --&gt;|固定槽位| D[类目分桶 + round-robin]&#10;    B --&gt;|全局配额| E[遍历 + 计数跳过]&#10;    C --&gt; F{冲突解?}&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt;|有替代| G[换入替代候选]&#10;    F --&gt;|无替代| H[放松约束&lt;br/&gt;权重最低的维度先破]&#10;    G --&gt; I[打散后列表]&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[去重后列表] --&gt; B{选择约束形态}\n    B --&gt;|前缀窗口| C[滑动计数 + 冲突时向后找替代]\n    B --&gt;|固定槽位| D[类目分桶 + round-robin]\n    B --&gt;|全局配额| E[遍历 + 计数跳过]\n    C --&gt; F{冲突解?}\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt;|有替代| G[换入替代候选]\n    F --&gt;|无替代| H[放松约束&lt;br/&gt;权重最低的维度先破]\n    G --&gt; I[打散后列表]\n    H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"滑动窗口打散的实现与替代查找\">滑动窗口打散的实现与替代查找</h2><p>前缀窗口的标准实现是一次遍历加一个计数窗口。遍历候选时维护「当前位置往前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 条内每个类目出现了几次」，若把当前商品放进去会违反上限，就把它推到<strong>延迟队列</strong>，继续看下一个候选；当某个类目在窗口内滑出、腾出配额时，再从延迟队列里回填。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"function scatterByWindow(items, keyFn, w, maxPerWindow):&#10;  out = []&#10;  deferred = []&#10;  counts = {}                      // 当前窗口内的计数&#10;  for item in items + deferredDrain:&#10;    c = keyFn(item)&#10;    expire(out, counts, w)         // 滑出窗口的条目减计数&#10;    if counts[c] &lt; maxPerWindow:&#10;      out.push(item); counts[c] += 1&#10;    else:&#10;      deferred.push(item)&#10;  // 遍历结束后回填延迟队列（此时可能仍违反约束）&#10;  return out.concat(deferred)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function scatterByWindow(items, keyFn, w, maxPerWindow):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  out = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deferred = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  counts = {}                      // 当前窗口内的计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for item in items + deferredDrain:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c = keyFn(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expire(out, counts, w)         // 滑出窗口的条目减计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if counts[c] &#x3C; maxPerWindow:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      out.push(item); counts[c] += 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      deferred.push(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 遍历结束后回填延迟队列（此时可能仍违反约束）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return out.concat(deferred)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里有三个必须明确的工程决策。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，<code>expire</code> 的时机。</strong> 窗口是「位置窗口」还是「时间窗口」？搜索结果的窗口一定是位置窗口，因为用户的浏览是按位置的。位置窗口意味着回填延迟项后，前面的位置会变化，需要重新计数——实现上通常是<strong>先定位置再计算</strong>，即每次 push 后立刻检查。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，延迟队列的排序。</strong> 回填时按原始相关性分降序回填，而不是先进先出。理由是约束已经放松，此时应按相关性择优，让「被迫接受重复」的那几条尽量是相关性最高的。先进先出会让一条低相关商品因为「先被延迟」而占到好位置。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，尾部放松的触发条件。</strong> 当延迟队列不为空且遍历结束时，必须放松约束。放松的顺序应该由配置决定（哪个维度先破），而不是算法自己决定。这是一个<strong>策略参数</strong>而非算法参数，其配置方式见 <a href=\"../diversity-ops/diversity-rule-config\">多样性规则按市场/品类配置</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多维度约束的冲突与四类解法\">多维度约束的冲突与四类解法</h2><p>真实系统同时约束品类、品牌、店铺三个维度，冲突不可避免。设品类约束是「窗口 10 内同类目 ≤2」、品牌是「窗口 10 内同品牌 ≤2」、店铺是「窗口 10 内同店铺 ≤1」，那么当候选集里 90% 商品来自同一个店铺（常见于某商家垄断某细分类目时），店铺约束和品类约束会同时不可满足。</p>\n<p>四类解法，按代价从低到高：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>维度优先级</td>\n<td>给维度排序，冲突时只破最低优先级维度</td>\n<td>低，实现简单</td>\n<td>维度重要性差异明确时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软硬约束混合</td>\n<td>品类硬约束、品牌软约束（超出扣分而非禁止）</td>\n<td>中，需调罚分权重</td>\n<td>品类不可妥协、品牌可让步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配额动态松弛</td>\n<td>冲突时按比例逐步放宽所有维度上限</td>\n<td>中，需收敛检查</td>\n<td>密集冲突、需平滑退化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局优化</td>\n<td>把打散写成整数规划/最小代价流，求全局最优</td>\n<td>高（毫秒级不可行）</td>\n<td>离线评估、生成训练标签</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中主流是<strong>第二类</strong>：把品类当硬约束（它是用户最不能容忍的塌缩），品牌和店铺当软约束——超出上限时不是禁止入选，而是加一个与超出程度成正比的分数惩罚。这样做的好处是把「不可满足的约束」问题转化成「可优化的目标」问题，算法永远有解，退化是平滑的而不是突兀的。</p>\n<p>软约束的形式通常是乘性惩罚：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>score</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">V</mi></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>v</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>window</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}&#x27;(d) = \\text{score}(d) \\cdot \\prod_{v \\in \\mathcal{V}} \\beta_v^{\\,\\max(0,\\, n_v(\\text{window}) - m_v)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">window</span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是软约束维度集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是窗口内该维度的当前计数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是上限，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_v \\in (0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是惩罚系数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_v = 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> 表示「该维度超出上限时，每条超出的商品分数乘 0.8，超得越多乘得越多」。这个形式的好处是它可以直接嵌进<strong>重排的排序键</strong>里，与相关性分数一起比较，不需要独立的一轮约束求解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"打散对相关性的影响与幅度控制\">打散对相关性的影响与幅度控制</h2><p>打散必然损失相关性——被推到后面的商品总有它该在更前面的理由。控制这个损失有三个手段。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，限制打散的作用范围。</strong> 打散只在前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条生效（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 常取 100–200，即 2–4 屏），超出范围后按纯相关性排序。理由是用户极难在第 5 屏后感知到同质，而打散在那里的相关性代价照样要付。这是性价比最高的一条。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，设置单条商品的最大后移位数。</strong> 一个商品因为打散被后移不能超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 位（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>）。这条限制了最坏情况：一个高度相关的商品不会因为类目冲突被打到很后面。实现上是在延迟队列中设置「到期位置」，超过后强制插入。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，按位置衰减打散强度。</strong> 窗口大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 或上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 随位置变化，越往后越宽松。例如「前 10 条窗口 5 内同类目 ≤2，10–30 条窗口 10 内 ≤3，30 条之后不约束」。这比一刀切更符合体感，也更容易与「限制作用范围」合并成同一套配置。</p>\n<p>三者的效果可以联合评估：打散前后的 nDCG 变化给出相关性代价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Homog</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">@</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Homog}@q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Homog</span></span><span class=\"mord\">@</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{eff}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的变化给出多样性收益（度量定义见 <a href=\"../diversity-metric/intra-list-diversity\">列表内同质度</a> 与 <a href=\"../diversity-metric/category-brand-diversity\">品类/品牌/店铺覆盖度</a>），两者的散点图判定法见 <a href=\"../diversity-metric/diversity-relevance-tradeoff\">多样性与相关性权衡度量</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与个性化打散的接口\">与个性化打散的接口</h2><p>当系统有用户画像时，「同品牌」是否算重复取决于用户——一个品牌忠诚用户看到五个同品牌手机壳可能很满意。因此打散的配额应该由<strong>用户维度的偏好强度</strong>调制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mtext>user</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mtext>clamp</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>affinity</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msubsup><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msubsup><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_v^{\\text{user}} = \\text{clamp}\\Big(m_v^{\\text{base}} \\cdot (1 + \\gamma \\cdot \\text{affinity}(u, v)),\\; m_v^{\\min},\\; m_v^{\\max}\\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9614em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">user</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">affinity</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8805em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>affinity</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{affinity}(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">affinity</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是用户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 对维度取值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>（如某品牌）的偏好强度（可用历史点击占比标准化），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 是调制幅度。品牌忠诚用户的品牌配额上限提高、探索型用户的配额降低。这条接口的输入是用户画像，输出是打散参数，因此它是「多样性策略消费个性化信号」的地方，而个性化本身如何生产、如何与隐私约束共存属于别的 hub 的主题（见 <a href=\"../personalization-balance/filter-bubble-mitigate\">个性化与多样性</a> 一章的边界说明）。</p>\n<p>需要注意一个顺序问题：<strong>个性化调制必须在配额求解之前完成</strong>，因为它改变的是约束本身。如果先按基础配额求解再试图调整结果，就会出现「已经满足基础约束的列表无法再容纳更多同品牌商品」的矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>散列窗口有三种形态：<strong>前缀窗口</strong>（最贴近体感）、<strong>固定槽位</strong>（round-robin，分布不均时尾部塌缩）、<strong>全局配额</strong>（可截断、最快）。</li>\n<li>前缀窗口实现 = 一次遍历 + 滑动计数 + 延迟队列；延迟队列回填按相关性降序，尾部必须放松约束。</li>\n<li>多维度冲突的四类解法中，<strong>品类硬约束 + 品牌/店铺软约束</strong>是主流；软约束写成乘性惩罚 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>v</mi></msub><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_v \\beta_v^{\\max(0, n_v - m_v)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3445em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5834em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1166em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，可直接嵌进重排排序键。</li>\n<li>控制相关性代价的三个手段：限制作用范围（前 100–200 条）、限制最大后移位数、按位置衰减打散强度。</li>\n<li>打散配额可由用户偏好调制，但个性化调制必须在<strong>配额求解之前</strong>完成。</li>\n<li>打散以 <a href=\"spu-seller-dedup\">SPU/同款去重</a> 为前提，效果用 <a href=\"../diversity-metric/intra-list-diversity\">列表内同质度</a> 与分布型度量衡量；超时时的降级路径见 <a href=\"../diversity-ops/diversity-degrade\">多样性计算超时降级</a>，跨页一致性见 <a href=\"pagination-dedup-consistency\">跨分页去重一致性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"品类与品牌散列窗口","id":"品类与品牌散列窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：窗口配额的三种形态","id":"核心概念-窗口配额的三种形态"},{"level":2,"text":"滑动窗口打散的实现与替代查找","id":"滑动窗口打散的实现与替代查找"},{"level":2,"text":"多维度约束的冲突与四类解法","id":"多维度约束的冲突与四类解法"},{"level":2,"text":"打散对相关性的影响与幅度控制","id":"打散对相关性的影响与幅度控制"},{"level":2,"text":"与个性化打散的接口","id":"与个性化打散的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SPU/同款/同店铺去重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-result-diversity-dedup/dedup-scatter/spu-seller-dedup"},"next":{"title":"跨分页去重一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-result-diversity-dedup/dedup-scatter/pagination-dedup-consistency"}}